Package: heatmapcerevisiae
Title: Reproduction of Figure 2A from Kelliher et al. 2016
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Audrey",
      family = "Onfroy",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "audrey.onfroy@ibens.fr",
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-1429-4230")
    )
Description: Reproduces the heatmap of the top 1246 periodic genes in
    Saccharomyces cerevisiae (Figure 2A) from Kelliher CM et al. (2016)
    PLoS Genet 12(12): e1006453. Expression profiles are z-scored and
    ordered by peak expression time using the supplementary data table.
